OL,3,AHow 'mogging' went from toxic term to
OL,4,Amainstream
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Mogging" has seen its usage soar over
OL,7,Fthe past year, with the Gen Z slang
OL,8,Fterm being named Collins English
OL,9,FDictionary's word of the year.
OL,11,FFinding its origins in the online
OL,12,Flanguage of the manosphere, an online
OL,13,Fcommunity built around hyper-masculine
OL,14,Fand often misogynistic content, the
OL,15,Fterm broke out into the mainstream this
OL,16,Fyear, being used by celebrities and the
OL,17,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
